            <figcaption>
                
                Only 11% of job losses in March and April were regained in May
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img04-lg.png?w=991&hash=72B960620F952D2DB0CF28A6B98106BE" alt="Figure 4. Only 11% of job losses in March and April were regained in May" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img04-lg.png?w=991&amp;hash=72B960620F952D2DB0CF28A6B98106BE 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img04-lg.png?w=800&amp;hash=971B9F325920D732641C77F16CD8ACB3 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig005 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig005-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 5 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                The economy has shed almost all of the jobs it added over the past expansion
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img05-lg.png?w=991&hash=3157C3D9C21F4E1D2D78C9CF049D0F67" alt="Figure 5. The economy has shed almost all of the jobs it added over the past expansion" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img05-lg.png?w=991&amp;hash=3157C3D9C21F4E1D2D78C9CF049D0F67 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img05-lg.png?w=800&amp;hash=AAE5BE4B7B477E999E1D04E6C28949E8 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig006 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig006-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 6 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                May&#39;s decline in the unemployment rate was not shared by blacks or Asians
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img06-lg.png?w=991&hash=8398B7CF86CEADD3702179FC69ACE642" alt="Figure 6. May&#39;s decline in the unemployment rate was not shared by blacks or Asians" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img06-lg.png?w=991&amp;hash=8398B7CF86CEADD3702179FC69ACE642 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img06-lg.png?w=800&amp;hash=EF92774EC5B1F89E3B61CD0B2E17C578 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
<div class="component image cf-image-component col-12">


<div class="cf-figure" >
    <figure>
     
            
                <a class="anchor" name=fig007 > </a>
                <div class="cf-figure_return link-button__list-group">
                    <a class="link-button__anchor" href=#fig007-ret>
                        <span class="cf-button--anchor cf-button--up">
                            Return to Figure 7 
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            
        

        
            <figcaption>
                
                Graduation rates for blacks are lower than for other groups and have not improved over time
            </figcaption>
        
       <img src="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img07-lg.png?w=991&hash=5AA60390F59D56F4BF05C23E99342083" alt="Figure 7. Graduation rates for blacks are lower than for other groups and have not improved over time" sizes="(min-width:992px) 800px,991px" srcset="/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img07-lg.png?w=991&amp;hash=5AA60390F59D56F4BF05C23E99342083 991w,/-/media/project/clevelandfedtenant/clevelandfedsite/collections/speeches/sp-20200617/sp-20200617-img07-lg.png?w=800&amp;hash=6182DAD9ADC335CC0D3257F020345DC6 800w" />
    </figure>

</div>
</div>
            </div>
        </div>
